  "generated_text": "For the first line, we have\n\\[\\begin{pmatrix} x \\\\ y \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 + 2t \\\\ 1 - 3t \\end{pmatrix}.\\]For the second line, we have\n\\[\\begin{pmatrix} x \\\\ y \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 5 + 4u \\\\ -9 + 2u \\end{pmatrix}.\\]Setting these equal, we get\n\\[1 + 2t = 5 + 4u,\\]\n\\[1 - 3t = -9 + 2u.\\]Solving these, we find\n\\[2t = 4,\\]\n\\[5t = 10.\\]Thus, $t = 2.$\n\nThen\n\\[\\begin{pmatrix} x \\\\ y \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 + 2(2) \\\\ 1 - 3(2) \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 5 \\\\ -5 \\end{pmatrix}.\\]\n\nTherefore, the point where the lines intersect is \\boxed{\\begin{pmatrix} 5 \\\\ -5 \\end{pmatrix}}.",
